{"page":116,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:46","surah":5,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَفَّيْنَا عَلَىٰٓ ءَاثَـٰرِهِم بِعِيسَى ٱبْنِ مَرْيَمَ مُصَدِّقًا لِّمَا بَيْنَ يَدَيْهِ مِنَ ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ ۖ وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ ٱلْإِنجِيلَ فِيهِ هُدًى وَنُورٌ وَمُصَدِّقًا لِّمَا بَيْنَ يَدَيْهِ مِنَ ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ وَهُدًى وَمَوْعِظَةً لِّلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent Jesus, son of Mary, in their footsteps, to confirm the Torah that had been sent before him: We gave him the Gospel with guidance, light, and confirmation of the Torah already revealed- a guide and lesson for those who take heed of God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَفَّيْنَا","en_gloss":"And We sent","transliteration":"waqaffaynā","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَاثَـٰرِهِم","en_gloss":"their footsteps","transliteration":"āthārihim","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِعِيسَى","en_gloss":"Isa","transliteration":"biʿīsā","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱبْنِ","en_gloss":"son","transliteration":"ib'ni","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَرْيَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Maryam","transliteration":"maryama","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مُصَدِّقًۭا","en_gloss":"confirming","transliteration":"muṣaddiqan","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِّمَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"limā","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"(was) between","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَدَيْهِ","en_gloss":"his hands","transliteration":"yadayhi","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Taurat","transliteration":"l-tawrāti","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"and We gave him","transliteration":"waātaynāhu","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْإِنجِيلَ","en_gloss":"the Injeel","transliteration":"l-injīla","verse_key":"5:46"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_glo