e between them according to what God has sent down. Do not follow their whims, which deviate from the truth that has come to you. We have assigned a law and a path to each of you. If God had so willed, He would have made you one community, but He wanted to test you through that which He has given you, so race to do good: you will all return to God and He will make clear to you the matters you differed about.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَنزَلْنَآ","en_gloss":"And We revealed","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"in [the] truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُصَدِّقًۭا","en_gloss":"confirming","transliteration":"muṣaddiqan","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِّمَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"limā","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"(was) before","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَدَيْهِ","en_gloss":"his hands","transliteration":"yadayhi","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَمُهَيْمِنًا","en_gloss":"and a guardian","transliteration":"wamuhayminan","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"over it","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَٱحْكُم","en_gloss":"So judge","transliteration":"fa-uḥ'kum","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَيْنَهُم","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"by what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"has revealed","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"5:48"},{"pos":17,"ar"