 they do not tempt you away from any of what God has sent down to you. If they turn away, remember that God intends to punish them for some of the sins they have committed: a great many people are lawbreakers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَنِ","en_gloss":"And that","transliteration":"wa-ani","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱحْكُم","en_gloss":"you judge","transliteration":"uḥ'kum","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَيْنَهُم","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"by what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"(has) revealed","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَتَّبِعْ","en_gloss":"follow","transliteration":"tattabiʿ","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَهْوَآءَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their vain desires","transliteration":"ahwāahum","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱحْذَرْهُمْ","en_gloss":"and beware of them","transliteration":"wa-iḥ'dharhum","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"lest","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَفْتِنُوكَ","en_gloss":"they tempt you away","transliteration":"yaftinūka","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَعْضِ","en_gloss":"some","transliteration":"baʿḍi","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"has revealed","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"5:49"},{"pos":19,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":